		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Shows the campaign's dialogue at the bottom of the screen as it plays, with its speaker.|Read from your own Halo: The Master Chief Collection installed with Steam: without it, this is off."/>
		<string text="The subtitles' language. Game's follows the game's language. A line the game's font cannot draw is shown in English."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="How wide stereo sounds from mods and custom maps are heard: left and right from either side, narrowing with distance. 0 makes each one point. The game's own sounds play as on the Xbox."/>
		<string text="How sounds are converted to your speakers' rate. Xbox sounds as the Xbox did; Clean is clearer; Classic is brighter but harsher. Xbox and Classic cost a little less."/>
